Third-party components
----------------------

Two components of this repository are adapted from the preliminary work of
Maksan (2026), which in turn originates from the Thales NEWSROOM / Saferlearn
context: the PATE aggregation and the teacher CNN architecture. See README.md
and Section 6.1 of the accompanying thesis for the provenance chain. The MIT
grant above is made by the copyright holder of this repository and does not
purport to relicense material whose rights are held elsewhere; anyone reusing
those two components should confirm their terms with the original authors.
